21	 * internally, Lottie knows to invalidate the bitmap and re-render it on the next frame. If the animation
22	 * never changes but your dynamic property does outside of Lottie, Lottie must be notified that it changed
23	 * in order to set the bitmap as dirty and re-render it on the next frame.
